{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33368","headline":"重归宜春经过萍川题梵林寺 · 袁皓","name":"重归宜春经过萍川题梵林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵林遗址在松萝，四十年来两度过。\n滤水东奔彭蠡浪，萍川西注洞庭波。\n村烟不改居人换，官路无穷行客多。\n拖紫腰金成底事，凭阑惆怅欲如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}